    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Because of plaque! Plaque is a sticky layer of germs that builds up on your teeth.",
      "punch": "plaque",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🦠",
        "text": "Plaque = sticky germs",
        "cue": "plaque",
        "sub": "Builds up on teeth",
        "sub_cue": "builds"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Germs? What do they do?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "The germs eat sugar from your food. Then they make acid, and acid can make tiny holes called cavities.",
      "board": {
        "type": "flow",
        "title": "How cavities start",
        "packet": "🍬",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🍬",
            "label": "Sugar",
            "cue": "sugar"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🧪",
            "label": "Acid",
            "cue": "acid"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🕳️",
            "label": "Cavity",
            "cue": "cavities"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Yikes! So brushing sweeps the germs away?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! Brushing cleans off the sticky plaque, so your teeth stay strong and shiny.",
      "board": {
        "type": "transform",
        "title": "Brush, brush!",
        "from": {
          "icon": "🦠",
          "label": "Sticky plaque",
          "cue": "brushing"
        },
        "to": {
          "icon": "😁",
          "label": "Clean teeth",
          "cue": "cleans"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "But why twice?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Plaque keeps coming back. So we brush in the morning, and at night before bed.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "Brush twice",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "☀️",
            "label": "Morning",
            "cue": "morning"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🌙",
            "label": "Night",
            "cue": "night"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "How long should I brush?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "About two minutes each time. Humming a song in your head can help the time go by!",
      "board": {
        "type": "picture",
        "art": "teeth",
        "caption": "About 2 minutes",
        "cue": "two",
        "icon": "⏱️"
      }
